Package: fuzzyfis
Type: Package
Title: Compiled Mamdani Fuzzy Inference Evaluator for the Mussel HSM Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Internal, project-only package providing evalfis_cpp2(), a
    compiled replacement for the ad hoc cppFunction() block previously
    embedded in functions_WS.R. Not published or intended for reuse outside
    this project. Built into the Docker image at image-build time (see
    Dockerfile) rather than compiled at container startup - changing
    src/evalfis2.cpp requires an image rebuild, unlike the R scripts, which
    are synced from S3 at runtime.
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: Rcpp
LinkingTo: Rcpp
License: Unlimited
